  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk - Tax Collector's Office | Newmarket, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Services   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk - Tax Collector's Office \r\nTown Clerk - Tax Collector's Office\t\t \r\nWelcome to the Town Clerk-Tax Collector's Office. The Town Clerk-Tax Collector serves a three-year term and coordinates all elections and town meetings, assisted by the Supervisors of the Checklist. \nThe Town Clerk-Tax Collector handles voter registration, motor vehicle registration, property taxes, dog licensing, vital records, and water/sewer collection. \nThis office can also obtain notary and Justice of the Peace services. \nThe Town Clerk-Tax Collector also serves as the official records depository for the Town and the Town Council. Minutes of Meetings, Ordinances, and Resolutions are all on file in this office. \nElection History 1987-Present \nTax Rate History \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tTerri J Littlefield\r\nTown Clerk & Tax Collector \r\nPhone: 603-659-3617, ext. 1305 \r\nTown Clerk-Tax Collector's Office \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 186 Main Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Newmarket ,  NH   03857 \r\n186 Main Street  Newmarket NH 03857 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone: 603-659-3617, ext. 4070 \r\nFax: 603-659-3441 \r\nHours of Operation \nMonday, Tuesday, Thursday \n7 am to 4:15 pm \nWednesday \n7 am to 6 pm \nFriday \nClosed \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Absentee Ballot Application  \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registration \r\n\t\t\t Copies Price List \r\n\t\t\t Dog License \r\n\t\t\t Election Information \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registrations \r\n\t\t\t NH Hunting & Fishing License \r\n\t\t\t Notary Services \r\n\t\t\t OHRV Registration \r\n\t\t\t Property Values Online Database \r\n\t\t\t Tax Collection \r\n\t\t\t Town Reports - Provided by the New Market Historical Society \r\n\t\t\t Trash Bags & Recycling \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Where Your Tax Dollars Go \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Permits \r\n\t\t\t Minutes & Agendas \r\n\t\t\t Subscribe to Alerts / News \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Newmarket \n186 Main Street \nNewmarket, NH 03857 \nPhone:  603-659-3617 \nTown Hall Office Hours \r\nQuick Links \r\n         FAQs \n         Job Opportunities \n         Events \n         News \n         Website Notifications \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nHelpful Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n     Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
